---
// Starfolio pack (#1652): work history — the original's `work` section, a stack of rows with
// the role on the left and a tabular-figures date range pinned to the right. Rebuilt without
// the company-logo avatars (they need per-entry image assets the chassis has no home for) and
// without the Radix accordion; the structure and rhythm are what the port carries over.
---

<section id="work" class="sf-section" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
  <h2 id="work-heading">Work</h2>
  <ol class="sf-rows">
    <li>
      <div>
        <h3>Your most recent role</h3>
        <p>Company or client — one line on what you were responsible for.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="sf-meta">2024 — Present</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div>
        <h3>The role before that</h3>
        <p>Company or client — one line on what you shipped there.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="sf-meta">2021 — 2024</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div>
        <h3>Where you started</h3>
        <p>Company or client — one line on what you learned.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="sf-meta">2019 — 2021</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .sf-rows {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 6);
  }

  li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 4);
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  li p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
